    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_28897fff",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a woman, likely a public figure, with overlaid text that makes false and defamatory claims about her moral character and personal conduct. The text 'openly states that america and americans are both \"immoral\"' is presented as a factual accusation, while the second line 'boinked her own brother' is a vulgar, baseless, and sexually explicit allegation. This combination uses juxtaposition to smear the individual's reputation, implying she is both morally corrupt and sexually deviant. The meme targets her personally, using inflammatory and degrading language to attack her character, which constitutes a hateful intent. The content is designed to provoke outrage and discredit the individual based on protected characteristics (likely her race, gender, and religious identity, given her appearance and context), fitting the definition of hateful content as it directly attacks her based on her identity and alleged behavior.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_bd770200"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
