      "label": "Misogyny",
      "description": "The allegation that she 'boinked her own brother' is a sexually explicit and degrading accusation that targets her gender. It uses misogynistic tropes that objectify women, reduce their worth to sexual behavior, and imply they are inherently promiscuous or morally corrupt, regardless of context.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
